{
  "scene_id": "scene.010_shadow_returns_second_coming",
  "description": "Chapter 10: The Second Coming",
  "entities": [],
  "locations": [
    {
      "id": "unknown",
      "name": "Unknown",
      "description": "Location: Realm/Physical/Unknown",
      "path": "Realm/Physical/Unknown",
      "type": "area"
    }
  ],
  "events": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 15,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Display tribal unity analysis,\"",
        "line": 27
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 31,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Acceptable,\"",
        "line": 49
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 33,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Tactical assessment for complete subjugation,\"",
        "line": 52
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 39,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Approved. Initiate creature deployment protocols. Begin with entry-level assets\u2014Gruulith for mountain regions, Dregans for desert territories, Brajor for coastal zones. Assess indigenous response capability before committing advanced resources.\"",
        "line": 60
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 53,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Cognitive capacity?\"",
        "line": 82
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 55,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Minimal and optimal,\"",
        "line": 85
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 62,
      "actor": "he",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"And the genetic source material?\"",
        "line": 94
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 63,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Derived from Giants captured during the First Coming pacification. Genetic sequences simplified, consciousness-integration pathways surgically removed, resilience factors enhanced by 470%. The Gruulith are, essentially, what Giants would be if stripped of everything that makes them people and optimized purely for combat functionality. They are the echo of a species, with the soul edited out.\"",
        "line": 96
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 81,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Deployment timeline?\"",
        "line": 118
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 83,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Gruulith generation one is combat-ready. Population: eight hundred units. Dregans: forty-seven solar cycles until maturation. Brajor: ninety-three solar cycles, pending resolution of thermal-regulation instabilities.\"",
        "line": 121
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 84,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Deploy the Gruulith to the northern mountain ranges. Prioritize the Ash Giant territories. Establish forward operating bases. I want response patterns, tactical adaptations, and psychological impact assessments. This is not merely a military action; it is a field test.\"",
        "line": 123
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 103,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Perimeter breach,\"",
        "line": 152
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 124,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"They are the mountain!\"",
        "line": 177
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 134,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"To the central spire!\"",
        "line": 190
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 141,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Who commands you?\"",
        "line": 199
      }
    }
  ],
